line-height:150%;mso-list:skip'><span style='font-size:13.0pt;line-height:150%;
font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;font-weight:normal'>S&#7889; l&#7847;n yêu
c&#7847;u chuy&#7875;n ti&#7879;c t&#7889;i &#273;a: 01 l&#7847;n, tr&#7915;
tr&#432;&#7901;ng h&#7907;p có s&#7921; &#273;&#7891;ng ý c&#7911;a Bên A. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=a style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;
margin-left:-11.0pt;mso-para-margin-top:6.0pt;mso-para-margin-right:0in;
